{"step_index":182,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:40:35Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T20:40:35+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T20:40:35+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/login.html`\nTotal Lines: 117\nTotal Bytes: 8376\nShowing lines 25 to 117\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n25:         </div>\n26:     </nav>\n27: \n28:     <main style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\">\n29:         <div class=\"search-card\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\">\n30:             <h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #0f172a;\">Authorized Portal Login</h1>\n31:             <p style=\"color: #64748b; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n32:                 Sign in with your accredited Verifier, Institution Officer, or Administrator account.\n33:             </p>\n34: \n35:             <div id=\"noticeBanner\" style=\"display: none; background: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; padding: 0.85rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n36:                 🔒 <strong>Verification Access Restricted:</strong> Credential verification is only accessible after an authorized user logs into the system.\n37:             </div>\n38: \n39:             <div id=\"loginError\" style=\"display: none; background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;\"></div>\n40: \n41:             <form onsubmit=\"handleLogin(event)\">\n42:                 <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n43:                     <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Username</label>\n44:                     <input type=\"text\" id=\"username\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"Enter username\" required autofocus>\n45:                 </div>\n46:                 <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n47:                     <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Password</label>\n48:                     <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"Enter password\" required>\n49:                 </div>\n50:                 <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Sign In & Access Portal</button>\n51:             </form>\n52: \n53:             <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569;\">\n54:                 <p style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #1e293b; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n55:                     <span>Demo Accounts & Role Access Matrix:</span>\n56:                     <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;\">(Click to auto-fill)</span>\n57:                 </p>\n58: \n59:                 <!-- Verifier Role -->\n60:                 <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n61:                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn chip-success\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('username').value='verifier';document.getElementById('password').value='Verifier@12345';\">\n62:                         <span>🔍 <strong>Accredited Verifier</strong> (Employer / Background Checker)</span>\n63:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">verifier</span>\n64:                     </button>\n65:                     <div style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #475569; padding-left: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n66:                         <span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">✓ Can Access:</span> Credential Verification Console, Blockchain Explorer, AI Anomaly Scanner.<br>\n67:                         <span style=\"color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;\">✕ No Access:</span> Cannot Issue Credentials, Cannot Revoke, Cannot Browse Qualifications Registry.\n68:                     </div>\n69:                 </div>\n70: \n71:                 <!-- Officer Role -->\n72:                 <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n73:                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn chip-neutral\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('username').value='officer_zou';document.getElementById('password').value='Officer@12345';\">\n74:                         <span>🏛️ <strong>ZOU Registrar Officer</strong> (Zimbabwe Open University)</span>\n75:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">officer_zou</span>\n76:                     </button>\n77:                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn chip-neutral\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('username').value='officer';document.getElementById('password').value='Officer@12345';\">\n78:                         <span>🏛️ <strong>NIT Registrar Officer</strong> (National Institute of Tech)</span>\n79:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">officer</span>\n80:                     </button>\n81:                     <div style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #475569; padding-left: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n82:                         <span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">✓ Can Access:</span> Issue New Qualifications, Institutional Registry, Verify Credentials, Blockchain Ledger.<br>\n83:                         <span style=\"color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;\">✕ No Access:</span> <strong>Cannot Revoke Credentials</strong> (Admin Only), No System Telemetry, No Audit Trail.\n84:                     </div>\n85:                 </div>\n86: \n87:                 <!-- Admin Role -->\n88:                 <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem;\">\n89:                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn chip-neutral\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('username').value='admin';document.getElementById('password').value='Admin@12345';\">\n90:                         <span>🛡️ <strong>System Administrator</strong> (DevOps Master Authority)</span>\n91:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">admin</span>\n92:                     </button>\n93:                     <div style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #475569; padding-left: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n94:                         <span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">✓ Full Master Access:</span> <strong>Revoke Credentials</strong>, Issue Credentials, Qualifications Registry, Server JVM Telemetry, Full Audit Trail.\n95:                     </div>\n96:                 </div>\n97:             </div>\n98:         </div>\n99:     </main>\n100: \n101:     <footer>\n102:         <p>DevOps Qualification Verification System &copy; 2026</p>\n103:     </footer>\n104: \n105:     <script src=\"/js/app.js\"></script>\n106:     <script>\n107:         document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n108:             const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n109:             if (params.get('notice') === 'verify_required' || params.get('notice') === 'auth_required') {\n110:                 const banner = document.getElementById('noticeBanner');\n111:                 if (banner) banner.style.display = 'block';\n112:             }\n113:         });\n114:     </script>\n115: </body>\n116: </html>\n117: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
